/T (SDN is useful for a smart city because a central controller can apply consistent policies, manage traffic engineering and update forwarding rules across many switches. The trade-offs are controller availability, security, skills and deployment cost. A resilient controller design and secure control channel are important.)
/E (SDN is useful for a smart city because a central controller can apply consistent policies, manage traffic engineering and update forwarding rules across many switches. The trade-offs are controller availability, security, skills and deployment cost. A resilient controller design and secure control channel are important.)
