781 0 obj
<<
/Title (If the /24 is divided into /26 blocks instead, there are four equal subnets, each with 62 usable hosts. This fits staff \(50\), library \(25\) and WAN \(2\), but the lab needs 100 hosts and does not fit. Thus no equal-size choice solves all four requirements within this /24.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 712 0 R
/Prev 780 0 R
>>
endobj
