/Title (The largest requirement is 100 hosts. Each equal-size subnet must therefore support at least 100 usable hosts. A /25 provides 126 usable hosts. However, 192.168.10.0/24 can be divided into only two /25 subnets, while the campus needs four separate networks. Therefore, equal-size subnetting cannot satisfy all four requirements inside this /24.)
