/Title (Traceroute sends probes with increasing TTL values. The first probe has TTL 1; the first router reduces it to zero and discards it, returning an ICMP Time Exceeded message. The next probe uses TTL 2 and reaches the second router before expiring. Repeating this process reveals each hop until the destination is reached. In IPv6, the corresponding message is ICMPv6 Time Exceeded.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 925 0 R
>>
